      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.44
    },
    {
      "id": "joke-professional-1",
      "text": "Humor is set low. I can help you find a project or contact Arif.",
      "src": "assets/audio/tars/joke-professional-1.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 5.354,
      "bytes": 43710,
      "sha256": "762910ba1218b5e841d1041ffb1041b02ead5262aca1e2c64678dab0ba643302",
      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.45
    },
    {
      "id": "joke-professional-2",
      "text": "Keeping things straightforward. Would you like a tour of Arif’s work?",
      "src": "assets/audio/tars/joke-professional-2.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 4.59,
      "bytes": 37566,
      "sha256": "183e3a7708e04d2ec92824890cca93da3fe8c6bbee6bcafcd8252b1c31f4bec2",
      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.46
    },
    {
      "id": "joke-dry-1",
      "text": "I tried small talk. It had too many dependencies.",
      "src": "assets/audio/tars/joke-dry-1.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 3.978,
      "bytes": 32565,
      "sha256": "080e5b4ca38639e4aec3c3e27c1c275f22fdaabfd7b568333bd0e15d213d4248",
      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.4
    },
    {
      "id": "joke-dry-2",
      "text": "The meeting could have been an automated workflow.",
      "src": "assets/audio/tars/joke-dry-2.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 3.29,
      "bytes": 27189,
      "sha256": "a4b9fa117ebde59d7ed53bd442c7d961269f9683c894e1478bace463f999222b",
      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.36
    },
    {
      "id": "joke-witty-1",
      "text": "Why did the automation take a holiday? It had already delegated the repetitive part.",
      "src": "assets/audio/tars/joke-witty-1.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 6.122,
      "bytes": 49847,
      "sha256": "5426640444cc6bdfd2d9b86de982751046f8d1618126d50c224678b9fbd58caf",
      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.31
    },
    {
      "id": "joke-witty-2",
      "text": "I asked the black hole for feedback. It absorbed the entire presentation.",
      "src": "assets/audio/tars/joke-witty-2.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 5.463,
      "bytes": 44471,
      "sha256": "0b2202f4f68b5b9623f3b98b59b5925bce427f5ca90f24fc000a112fe6efd5a4",
      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.48
    },
    {
      "id": "joke-mischievous-1",
      "text": "I put procrastination on autopilot. It will start tomorrow.",
      "src": "assets/audio/tars/joke-mischievous-1.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 5.059,
      "bytes": 41213,
      "sha256": "e49ffe59ebbab6675888fcd6bb92d4e85261096a90a38509480ff1a7c0704407",
      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.64
    },
    {
      "id": "joke-mischievous-2",
      "text": "My plan has three steps: look useful, roll confidently, and blame gravity.",
      "src": "assets/audio/tars/joke-mischievous-2.mp3",
      "durationSeconds": 6.043,
      "bytes": 49085,
      "sha256": "900decebbcdb02bab2300bca1f879747f4b76c49406678a3e9621500c072782d",
      "codec": "mp3",
      "sampleRate": 24000,
      "channels": 1,
      "peakDbFS": -2.54
    },
    {
